cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FIBEMATE
message: >-
  If you use FIBEMATE in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tianhe
    family-names: Liu
    orcid: null
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Lennonhaha/fibemate'
url: 'https://fibemate.net'
abstract: >-
  FIBEMATE is a post-quantum cryptography full-stack engineering verification platform.
  It implements ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203), ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204, fml-dsa native JS with proven Noble interop),
  SLH-DSA-128s (FIPS 205, WASM bridge), and Chinese national standards SM2/SM3/SM4,
  with application-layer ML-KEM-768 hybrid key exchange, FPGA hardware acceleration,
  and TLA+ formal verification with QROM security model documentation.
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ML-DSA-65
  - fml-dsa
  - ML-KEM-768
  - FIPS 203
  - TLS 1.3
  - hybrid key exchange
  - SM2
  - SM3
  - SM4
  - FPGA
  - TLA+
  - formal verification
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: 3.3.0
date-released: '2026-08-31'
